snes9x2002 (PocketSNES / Snes9x 1.39 libretro port)
https://github.com/libretro/snes9x2002
vendored at commit 6ffbf9ef4f0063e1f1b78a40d10c50fc52f2524c

Interpreter C path only (ppu_.c / gfx.c / tile.c). ARM assembler, ASMCPU,
and ASM_SPC700 are not shipped.

Snes9x is freeware for PERSONAL / non-commercial use. See LICENSE.
libretro-common headers (boolean.h, retro_inline.h, retro_common_api.h,
memory_stream) are MIT.

Local patches:
- MAX_ROM_SIZE 4 MB (was 6 MB) plus 64 KB C4 RAM after the ROM buffer
- LoadROM can consume a ROM already copied into Memory.ROM (no second copy)
- memset32/memset16 fill a 32/16-bit pattern on non-ARM (was a byte memset)
- Large BSS (maps, echo, DMA scratch, DSP tables) in PSRAM via EXT_RAM_BSS_ATTR
- Cheat search RAM omitted; S9xInitCheatData / S9xApplyCheats are empty stubs
